        "latin": "Fa-al-ḥamdu lillāhil-ladhī bi-taḥmīdihi yuṣaddaru kullu khiṭāb, wa bi-ḥamdihi yatanaʿʿamu ahlun-naʿīmi fī dāril-jazāʾi wath-thawāb. Wa bi-ismihi yushfā kullu dāʾ, wa bihi yukshafu kullu ghammin wa balāʾ, wa ilayhi turfaʿul-aydī bit-taḍarruʿi wad-duʿāʾi fīsh-shiddati war-rakhāʾi was-sarrāʾi waḍ-ḍarrāʾ. Wa huwa sāmiʿul-li-jamīʿil-aṣwāt, bi-funūnil-khiṭābi ʿalā-khtilāfil-lughāt, wa mujībud-duʿāʾi lil-muḍṭarr. Fa-lahul-ḥamdu ʿalā kulli mā awlā wa asdā, wa lahash-shukru ʿalā kulli mā anʿama wa aʿṭā.",
